libarms
------------------------------------------
libarms is a client library for SMFv2 system supplied by IIJ.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libarms-devel-6.50-1bl2
  libarms0-6.50-1bl2
  libexpat1-2.10.0-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libexpat-devel-2.10.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://dev.smf.jp/libarms/

Canonical download:
  https://dev.smf.jp/dl/libarms-6.50.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libarms-6.50-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libarms-6.50-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libarms-6.50-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarms-6.50-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarms0-6.50-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libarms-devel-6.50-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libarms)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libarms.README
  /usr/share/doc/libarms/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libarms/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libarms/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libarms/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libarms/README

(libarms0)
  /usr/bin/cygarms-0.dll

(libarms-devel)
  /usr/include/libarms.h
  /usr/lib/libarms.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libarms.pc

